          "script": "",
          "style": "Transparent",
          "contents": "Get all 52 cards onto the four foundations at the top right, each suit from ace up to king. Columns build down in alternating colors: a red 6 goes on a black 7. Any card can go in an empty column, and the four free cells at the top left hold one card each. You can move a run at once if the free cells and empty columns would let you move it a card at a time. Game numbers match Windows FreeCell's; of its first 32,000 deals, only game 11982 can't be won.",
