          },
          "script": "on mouseUp\n  global gSMoves\n  ask \"Play which game? (1 to 1000000)\" with gSGame\n  if it is empty then exit mouseUp\n  if it is not a number or it < 1 or it > 1000000 or it is not trunc(it) then\n    answer \"Games are numbered from 1 to 1000000.\"\n    exit mouseUp\n  end if\n  put it into n\n  abandonGame gSMoves\n  newGame n\nend mouseUp",
